text = "BOUNCER vs SHAPE-HUNT WALLS
P1: arrows + Space
Touch the bulb to pick up the Bouncer familiar, then watch it ricochet off the
star-shaped outer wall (reused from the shape-hunt level) and the central wall.
Tap to shoot; hold and release to dash. F9 restarts; F8 stops."
